<section class="crm-workspace"><header class="page-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">BROADCAST</p><h1>Riwayat · <?= e($project['name']) ?></h1><p>Ringkasan hasil gateway, bukan bukti pesan sampai atau dibaca. Membuka progres tidak mengirim pesan.</p></div><a class="crm-secondary" href="<?= e(base_url('crm?project_id='.(int)$project['id'])) ?>">← CRM proyek</a></header><div class="crm-panel crm-table-scroll"><table class="crm-table"><thead><tr><th>Dibuat (WIB)</th><th>Pesan / tahap</th><th>Penerima</th><th>Hasil gateway</th><th>Tindakan</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($items as $item): ?><tr><td><?= e($item['created_at']) ?></td><td><?= e($item['template_name']) ?><small class="sales-small"><?= e($item['stage_filters']?implode(', ',array_map(static fn($code)=>$stages[$code]['label']??$code,$item['stage_filters'])):'Semua tahap') ?></small></td><td><?= (int)$item['processed'] ?> / <?= (int)$item['eligible'] ?> diproses<small class="sales-small"><?= (int)$item['remaining'] ?> belum diproses</small></td><td><?= (int)$item['accepted'] ?> diterima · <?= (int)$item['failed'] ?> ditolak<small class="sales-small"><?= (int)$item['unknown'] ?> belum pasti · <?= (int)$item['skipped'] ?> dilewati · <?= (int)$item['duplicates'] ?> duplikat</small></td><td><a class="crm-secondary" href="<?= e(base_url('crm?project_id='.(int)$project['id'].'&resume='.$item['token'])) ?>">Buka progres</a></td></tr><?php endforeach ?><?php if(!$items): ?><tr><td colspan="5">Belum ada broadcast pada proyek ini.</td></tr><?php endif ?></tbody></table></div><nav class="crm-pagination"><?php if($page>1): ?><a href="<?= e(base_url('crm/broadcastHistory?project_id='.(int)$project['id'].'&page='.($page-1))) ?>">Sebelumnya</a><?php endif ?><span>Halaman <?= (int)$page ?></span><?php if($hasNext): ?><a href="<?= e(base_url('crm/broadcastHistory?project_id='.(int)$project['id'].'&page='.($page+1))) ?>">Berikutnya</a><?php endif ?></nav></section>